# ---- archie-research: Archie's own xAI key (BH-4065, hub only) ----
# The research scout's X searches (bin/archie-research.sh scan) call the xAI
# API directly with THIS key and no other. To turn X on: create a new xAI API
# key for Archie at console.x.ai with its own monthly spend limit, then put it
# here, in /etc/harness/env/global.env on the hub (BH-4762). It is
# never the grok runner's XAI_API_KEY (or GROK_CODE_XAI_API_KEY): the lane
# refuses to call when they are equal. It lives in /etc/harness/env/global.env
# on the hub only. Unset, the X half is skipped with one ALERTS line a day and
# the web half still runs. The lane's knobs (daily cap, topics, attempts) are
# settings rows: catalog/lanes.d/archie-research.json.
#ARCHIE_XAI_API_KEY=
